---

<Layout
  title="Specifiche Tecniche Alfa 156 (Technical Information) | Cuore Sportivo Archive"
  description="Specifiche tecniche e schede motori ufficiali di alfa156.net: potenze, coppie, pesi, rapporti di trasmissione e geometrie sospensioni."
  currentPath="/technical"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-alfa-red-600">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">Technical</span>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white font-medium">
        <span class="lang-it">Specifiche Tecniche</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Technical Specs</span>
      </span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Sub-navigation Hub Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-1.5 mb-8 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/technical"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold bg-alfa-red-600 text-white shadow-xs"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Specifiche Motori & Telaio</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Engine & Chassis Specs</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/technical/tips"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Tips & Guide Passo-Passo</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Tips & DIY Guides</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/technical/tuning"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Tuning & Elaborazioni</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Tuning & Handling</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pb-8 mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
        <span class="lang-it">Dati Tecnici Alfa Romeo 156</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Alfa Romeo 156 Technical Information</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        <span class="lang-it">
          Tutti i dati tecnici ufficiali di motorizzazioni Twin Spark, JTS, V6 Busso e JTD: trasmissioni, pesi, rapporti di cambio e geometrie delle sospensioni per berlina e Sportwagon.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          Comprehensive technical specifications for Twin Spark, JTS, Busso V6, and JTD powertrains: gear ratios, kerb weights, chassis geometries, and factory wheel fitments for saloon and Sportwagon.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table 1: Engines 1997-2001 (Euro 2) -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Motori Prima Serie (1997 - 2001, Euro 2)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Engines (1997 - 2001, Euro 2)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mt-1">
            Twin Spark 16V con collettori d'aspirazione a geometria variabile, Busso V6 24V e JTD Unijet Common Rail
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/90 text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-200 border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Motor</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Kw (CV) / RPM</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Ccm</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Nm / (RPM)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Top Speed</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">0-100 km/h</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Weight (Kg)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Wheels</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-alfa-metal-200 dark:divide-alfa-metal-800 bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 font-mono">
            {enginesEuro2.map((e) => (
              <tr class="hover:bg-alfa-red-50/40 dark:hover:bg-alfa-metal-900/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-3 font-sans font-bold text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400">{e.motor}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.power}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.ccm}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.torque}</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">{e.topSpeed} km/h</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.accel} s</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.weight}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.wheels}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Table 2: Euro 3 Engines (2001->) -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Motori Euro 3 (2001 in poi)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Euro 3 Engines (2001 onwards)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mt-1">
            Aggiornamento normative anti-inquinamento con acceleratore elettronico drive-by-wire
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/90 text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-200 border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Motor</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Kw (CV) / RPM</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Ccm</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Nm / (RPM)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Top Speed</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">0-100 km/h</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Weight (Kg)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Wheels</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-alfa-metal-200 dark:divide-alfa-metal-800 bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 font-mono">
            {enginesEuro3.map((e) => (
              <tr class="hover:bg-alfa-red-50/40 dark:hover:bg-alfa-metal-900/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-3 font-sans font-bold text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400">{e.motor}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.power}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.ccm}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.torque}</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">{e.topSpeed} km/h</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.accel} s</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.weight}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.wheels}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400 mt-2 italic">
        *) Nota originale: il 2.0 TS è stato successivamente sostituito dal 2.0 JTS a iniezione diretta da 165 CV e il 2.4 JTD dalla versione 10V da 150 CV (Q2 2002).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table 3: Facelift 2002 & GTA -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Facelift 2002, GTA e Motori Multijet (2002 - 2005)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Facelift 2002, GTA & Multijet Engines (2002 - 2005)</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mt-1">
            L'apice prestazionale: Busso 3.2 V6 GTA, JTS a iniezione diretta e l'esordio del Multijet 20V da 175 CV
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/90 text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-200 border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Motor</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Kw (CV) / RPM</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Ccm</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Nm / (RPM)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Top Speed</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">0-100 km/h</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Weight (Kg)</th>
              <th class="p-3 font-bold">Wheels</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-alfa-metal-200 dark:divide-alfa-metal-800 bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 font-mono">
            {enginesFacelift.map((e) => (
              <tr class="hover:bg-alfa-red-50/40 dark:hover:bg-alfa-metal-900/50 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-3 font-sans font-bold text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400">{e.motor}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.power}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.ccm}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.torque}</td>
                <td class="p-3 font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">{e.topSpeed} km/h</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-800 dark:text-alfa-silver-200">{e.accel} s</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.weight}</td>
                <td class="p-3 text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">{e.wheels}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400 mt-2 italic">
        Nota: per le versioni Sportwagon aggiungere indicativamente 50 kg di massa a vuoto.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Chassis, Suspension & Brakes Deep Dive (verbatim from teknisk and history) -->
    <div class="border-t border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pt-10 mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        <span class="lang-it">Telaio, Geometrie Sospensioni e Impianto Frenante</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Chassis, Suspension Geometry & Braking</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Card 1: Front Suspension -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-alfa-red-50 dark:bg-alfa-red-950 flex items-center justify-center text-alfa-red-600 mb-4 font-bold">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            <span class="lang-it">Quadrilatero Alto Anteriore</span>
            <span class="lang-en">High Double Wishbone Front</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="lang-it">
              Sospensioni anteriori a doppio triangolo sovrapposto (quadrilatero alto) con componenti in ghisa, acciaio e lega leggera. Geometria con 4° di incidenza positiva (castor) e 6-7° di kingpin angle. Garantisce massima aderenza in trazione anteriore, totale recupero di camber in curva e precisione di sterzo chirurgica (2.2 giri da battuta a battuta).
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Front suspensions set up by high double triangle wishbone with cast iron, steel and light alloy components. Geometry includes 4 degrees of positive castor and 6-7 degrees of kingpin angle, providing unmatched front-wheel grip and precision steering (2.2 turns lock-to-lock).
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Rear Suspension -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-alfa-red-50 dark:bg-alfa-red-950 flex items-center justify-center text-alfa-red-600 mb-4 font-bold">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            <span class="lang-it">McPherson Posteriore con Sterzatura Passiva</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Rear McPherson with Passive Steering</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="lang-it">
              Schema McPherson evoluto con montante telescopico, due bielle trasversali di lunghezza disuguale e puntone di reazione longitudinale. Questo sistema induce una sterzatura passiva in fase delle ruote posteriori sotto carico laterale in curva, aumentando la stabilità alle alte velocità e riducendo il sottosterzo.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              At the rear, McPherson struts with unequal length transverse links and longitudinal reaction rods. This setup provides same-phase passive rear wheel steering under cornering loads, stabilizing the rear axle and improving high-speed cornering agility.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: ABS & Brakes -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-alfa-red-50 dark:bg-alfa-red-950 flex items-center justify-center text-alfa-red-600 mb-4 font-bold">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            <span class="lang-it">Impianto Frenante & ABS Bosch 5.3</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Braking & Bosch 5.3 ABS</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed">
            <span class="lang-it">
              Freni a disco su tutte le ruote (anteriori autoventilati su 1.8, 2.0, 2.5 V6 e JTD; pinze Brembo a 4 pistoncini su GTA). Centralina ABS Bosch 5.3 a 4 sensori attivi con ripartitore elettronico di frenata EBD (Electronic Brake Distribution) e sistema antincendio FPS (Fire Prevention System) di serie.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Disc brakes on all four wheels (ventilated front on 1.8, 2.0, 2.5 V6 and JTD; 4-piston Brembo radial calipers on GTA). Bosch 5.3 ABS ECU with 4 active wheel sensors, Electronic Brake Distribution (EBD) and Alfa Fire Prevention System (FPS) standard.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Dimensions & Weights -->
    <div class="border-t border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
        <span class="lang-it">Dimensioni e Pesi Ufficiali</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Official Dimensions & Capacities</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 font-mono text-center">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
          <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Lunghezza</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mt-1">4430 mm</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
          <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Larghezza</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mt-1">1745 mm</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
          <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Altezza</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mt-1">1415 mm <span class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 font-normal">(1420 SW)</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800">
          <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Passo</div>
          <div class="text-lg font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mt-1">2595 mm</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
